Explicit fused multiply-add in the inverse 9/7 lifting step. Clang contracts
these assignments into fmadd on arm64, and the desktop's bundled Poppler
decodes with that rounding; wasm32 has no fused instruction, so fmaf keeps
the same rounding there.
--- a/src/lib/openjp2/dwt.c
+++ b/src/lib/openjp2/dwt.c
@@ -3320,28 +3320,28 @@
